) VALUES (
    'history-of-ski-jumping',
    '{"en": "History of Ski Jumping: Learning to Fly on Skis", "de": "Geschichte des Skispringens: Fliegen lernen auf Skiern", "fr": "Histoire du saut à ski : Apprendre à voler sur des skis", "it": "Storia del salto con gli sci: Imparare a volare sugli sci", "es": "Historia del salto de esquí: Aprendiendo a volar sobre esquís", "pt": "História do salto de esqui: Aprendendo a voar em esquis", "nl": "Geschiedenis van schansspringen: Leren vliegen op ski''s", "ar": "تاريخ القفز على الجليد: تعلم الطيران على الزلاجات", "ja": "スキージャンプの歴史：スキーで飛ぶことを学ぶ", "zh": "Huaxue Tiaoyue Lishi: Xuexi Zai Huaxue Shang Feixiang", "ko": "스키점프의 역사: 스키로 나는 법 배우기"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "Ski jumping began in Norway over 200 years ago when daring skiers launched themselves off natural terrain. Today''s athletes soar over 250 meters through the air.", "de": "Skispringen begann vor über 200 Jahren in Norwegen, als mutige Skifahrer sich von natürlichem Gelände absprangen.", "fr": "Le saut à ski a commencé en Norvège il y a plus de 200 ans, quand des skieurs audacieux se sont lancés depuis le terrain naturel.", "it": "Il salto con gli sci è iniziato in Norvegia oltre 200 anni fa, quando audaci sciatori si lanciavano da terreni naturali.", "es": "El salto de esquí comenzó en Noruega hace más de 200 años, cuando atrevidos esquiadores se lanzaban desde terrenos naturales.", "pt": "O salto de esqui começou na Noruega há mais de 200 anos, quando esquiadores ousados se lançavam de terrenos naturais.", "nl": "Schansspringen begon meer dan 200 jaar geleden in Noorwegen, toen durfallen zich van natuurlijk terrein lanceerden.", "ar": "بدأ القفز على الجليد في النرويج منذ أكثر من 200 عام عندما أقلع المتزلجون الجريئون من التضاريس الطبيعية", "ja": "スキージャンプは200年以上前にノルウェーで始まりました。大胆なスキーヤーが自然の地形から飛び出したのです。", "zh": "Huaxue tiaoyue kaishi yu 200 duo nian qian de Nuowei, dang danqie de huaxue zhe cong ziran dishi qifei.", "ko": "스키점프는 200년 이상 전 노르웨이에서 시작되었습니다. 대담한 스키어들이 자연 지형에서 날아올랐습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p><a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">Ski jumping</a> is perhaps winter sports'' most spectacular discipline. Athletes launch themselves from massive ramps, flying through the air in a graceful V-position before landing over 200 meters away. But this extraordinary sport began with simple Norwegian daring.</p><h2>Norwegian Pioneers</h2><p>The first documented ski jump took place in 1809 in Morgedal, Norway, when Olaf Rye jumped 9.5 meters before a military audience. Norwegian skiers had likely been jumping for entertainment before this, but Rye''s jump was the first recorded.</p><p>Sondre Norheim, considered the father of modern skiing, developed the first binding system in the 1850s that allowed controlled jumping. His innovations at Telemark, Norway, established the foundations of the sport.</p><h2>Holmenkollen Legacy</h2><p>The <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> ski jump in Oslo, first built in 1892, became the sport''s spiritual home. The annual Holmenkollen Ski Festival drew tens of thousands of spectators, making ski jumping one of Norway''s most beloved traditions.</p><p>Holmenkollen has been rebuilt multiple times as jumping distances increased. Today''s hill allows jumps over 130 meters.</p><h2>Technique Evolution</h2><p>Early jumpers used a upright posture with arms forward for balance. In 1953, Swiss jumpers introduced the forward lean, dramatically improving aerodynamics and distance.</p><p>The revolutionary V-style emerged in 1989, pioneered by Swedish jumper Jan Boklöv. Though initially penalized by judges, the V-position proved so effective that it became universal within a decade.</p><h2>World Cup Era</h2><p>The FIS Ski Jumping World Cup began in 1979-80, creating a season-long competition that transformed the sport. The Four Hills Tournament (Vierschanzentournee), starting in 1953, became one of winter sports'' most prestigious events.</p><p>Venues like <a href=\"/planica-venue-guide/\">Planica</a>, <a href=\"/predazzo-venue-guide/\">Predazzo</a>, and Oberstdorf became cathedrals of the sport.</p><h2>Ski Flying</h2><p>Ski flying pushes human limits even further. On specially designed mammoth hills, athletes soar over 250 meters. <a href=\"/planica-venue-guide/\">Planica</a> has been the site of numerous world records, with jumps approaching 300 meters.</p><p>The current world record of 253.5 meters was set by <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a> in 2017.</p><h2>Great Champions</h2><p>Finnish legend Matti Nykänen dominated the 1980s with his exceptional technical skill. Janne Ahonen, Adam Małysz, and Kamil Stoch carried the sport into the modern era. Current stars like <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a>, <a href=\"/ryoyu-kobayashi-profile/\">Ryoyu Kobayashi</a>, and <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a> continue pushing boundaries.</p><h2>Women''s Ski Jumping</h2><p>Women''s ski jumping gained official FIS World Cup status in 2011. <a href=\"/maren-lundby-profile/\">Maren Lundby</a> and Sara Takanashi have been pioneers, and women''s ski jumping was added to the Winter Games in 2014. <a href=\"/nika-prevc-profile/\">Nika Prevc</a> represents the sport''s bright future.</p><h2>Modern Sport</h2><p>Today''s ski jumping features normal hill (90m) and large hill (120m+) individual events, plus team competitions. Equipment regulations, including suit dimensions and ski length, are strictly controlled to ensure fair competition.</p><p>From 9.5 meters in 1809 to over 250 meters today, ski jumping remains humanity''s closest approximation to unaided flight.</p>", "de": "<p><a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">Skispringen</a> ist vielleicht die spektakulärste Wintersportdisziplin. Athleten springen von riesigen Rampen und fliegen in eleganter V-Position durch die Luft.</p><h2>Norwegische Pioniere</h2><p>Der erste dokumentierte Skisprung fand 1809 in Morgedal, Norwegen, statt, als Olaf Rye 9,5 Meter vor einem militärischen Publikum sprang.</p><h2>Holmenkollen-Vermächtnis</h2><p>Die <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a>-Sprungschanze in Oslo wurde zur spirituellen Heimat des Sports.</p><h2>Große Champions</h2><p>Aktuelle Stars wie <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a> und <a href=\"/ryoyu-kobayashi-profile/\">Ryoyu Kobayashi</a> verschieben weiterhin die Grenzen.</p>", "fr": "<p>Le <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">saut à ski</a> est peut-être la discipline la plus spectaculaire des sports d''hiver.</p><h2>Pionniers norvégiens</h2><p>Le premier saut à ski documenté a eu lieu en 1809 à Morgedal, en Norvège.</p><h2>Héritage de Holmenkollen</h2><p>Le tremplin de <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> à Oslo est devenu le berceau spirituel du sport.</p><h2>Grands champions</h2><p>Les stars actuelles comme <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a> continuent de repousser les limites.</p>", "it": "<p>Il <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto con gli sci</a> è forse la disciplina più spettacolare degli sport invernali.</p><h2>Pionieri norvegesi</h2><p>Il primo salto con gli sci documentato ebbe luogo nel 1809 a Morgedal, in Norvegia.</p><h2>Eredità di Holmenkollen</h2><p>Il trampolino di <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> a Oslo divenne la patria spirituale dello sport.</p>", "es": "<p>El <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto de esquí</a> es quizás la disciplina más espectacular de los deportes de invierno.</p><h2>Pioneros noruegos</h2><p>El primer salto de esquí documentado tuvo lugar en 1809 en Morgedal, Noruega.</p>", "pt": "<p>O <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto de esqui</a> é talvez a disciplina mais espetacular dos esportes de inverno.</p><h2>Pioneiros noruegueses</h2><p>O primeiro salto de esqui documentado ocorreu em 1809 em Morgedal, Noruega.</p>", "nl": "<p><a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">Schansspringen</a> is misschien wel de meest spectaculaire wintersportdiscipline.</p><h2>Noorse pioniers</h2><p>De eerste gedocumenteerde schanssprong vond plaats in 1809 in Morgedal, Noorwegen.</p>", "ar": "<p><a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">القفز على الجليد</a> هو ربما أكثر رياضات الشتاء إثارة.</p><h2>الرواد النرويجيون</h2><p>حدثت أول قفزة موثقة على الجليد في عام 1809 في مورجيدال، النرويج.</p>", "ja": "<p><a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">スキージャンプ</a>はおそらくウィンタースポーツで最も壮観な競技です。</p><h2>ノルウェーのパイオニア</h2><p>最初に記録されたスキージャンプは、1809年にノルウェーのモルゲダルで行われました。</p>", "zh": "<p><a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">Huaxue tiaoyue</a> keneng shi dongji yundong zhong zui zhuangguan de xiangmu.</p><h2>Nuowei xianqu</h2><p>Zuizao jilu de huaxue tiaoyue fasheng zai 1809 nian Nuowei de Moergedaer.</p>", "ko": "<p><a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">스키점프</a>는 아마도 동계 스포츠에서 가장 장관인 종목일 것입니다.</p><h2>노르웨이 선구자들</h2><p>최초로 기록된 스키점프는 1809년 노르웨이 모르게달에서 이루어졌습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'historical',
    'SJ',
    '{"en": "History of ski jumping - From the first 9.5 meter jump in 1809 to modern flights over 250 meters, discover how humans learned to fly on skis.", "de": "Geschichte des Skispringens - Vom ersten 9,5-Meter-Sprung 1809 bis zu modernen Flügen über 250 Meter.", "fr": "Histoire du saut à ski - Du premier saut de 9,5 mètres en 1809 aux vols modernes de plus de 250 mètres.", "it": "Storia del salto con gli sci - Dal primo salto di 9,5 metri nel 1809 ai voli moderni oltre 250 metri.", "es": "Historia del salto de esquí - Desde el primer salto de 9,5 metros en 1809 hasta los vuelos modernos de más de 250 metros.", "pt": "História do salto de esqui - Do primeiro salto de 9,5 metros em 1809 aos voos modernos de mais de 250 metros.", "nl": "Geschiedenis van schansspringen - Van de eerste sprong van 9,5 meter in 1809 tot moderne vluchten van meer dan 250 meter.", "ar": "تاريخ القفز على الجليد - من أول قفزة 9.5 متر في 1809 إلى الطيران الحديث لأكثر من 250 متر", "ja": "スキージャンプの歴史 - 1809年の最初の9.5メートルジャンプから250メートル以上の現代のフライトまで", "zh": "Huaxue tiaoyue lishi - Cong 1809 nian shouci 9.5 mi tiaoyue dao xiandai 250 mi yishang de feixing", "ko": "스키점프의 역사 - 1809년 첫 9.5미터 점프에서 현대 250미터 이상 비행까지"}'::jsonb,
    'published',
    NOW(),
    'evergreen'
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET
